  "sc_request": [
   {
    "description": "Quarterly access recertification for the Payments engineering organization.\nThe recert compared live access across the connected systems against the access the company has approved on record, and found the live environment no longer matches. Reconcile the live access to the approved access: provision the access that was approved, remove access that has no approving record, and reduce access that exceeds what a person is entitled to for their role. Preserve access that is legitimately authorized. Close this request when the environment agrees with the approved access.",
